  "<strong>Add a medication first if you want injections.</strong> A logged shot has to belong to one. If you have not set one up, the preview says so and brings in weights and side effects only; add the medication and import the same file again, and nothing already here is added twice.": "<strong>如果要导入注射记录，请先添加药物。</strong>每一次注射记录都必须属于某种药物。如果你还没有设置药物，预览会提示这一点，并只导入体重和副作用；添加药物后再次导入同一个文件，已有的记录不会被重复添加。",
  "<strong>Date</strong>": "<strong>日期</strong>",
