  "Dozify helps you track GLP-1 injections, rotate sites, log weight, and get reminders: fully offline, with your data staying on your device.": "Dozify 帮你记录 GLP-1 注射、轮换注射部位、记录体重并接收提醒：完全离线，数据始终保存在你的设备上。",
  "Dozify is a tracking tool, not a medical device. It does not recommend doses and does not provide medical advice. Ozempic®, Wegovy®, Mounjaro®, Saxenda®, Zepbound®, Trulicity®, Victoza® and Rybelsus® are trademarks of their respective owners; Dozify is not affiliated with these companies.": "Dozify 是一款记录工具，不是医疗器械。它不推荐剂量，也不提供医疗建议。Ozempic®、Wegovy®、Mounjaro®、Saxenda®、Zepbound®、Trulicity®、Victoza® 和 Rybelsus® 是其各自所有者的商标；Dozify 与这些公司没有关联。",
  "Dozify says so rather than importing zero rows quietly. Any CSV with a date column will read. If yours does not, send it from Settings → Suggest a feature and the format gets added: a file we cannot read is our gap, not yours.": "Dozify 会明确告诉你，而不是悄悄导入零行。任何带有日期列的 CSV 都能读取。如果你的文件读不了，请在“设置 → 提个功能建议”中发送给我们，我们会添加该格式：读不了的文件是我们的不足，不是你的问题。",
