  "Months of injections, weigh-ins and side effects are the reason people stay in an app they have stopped liking. Nobody retypes a year of shots, so the record becomes the lock. Moving it across is the only part that matters.": "几个月的注射、称重和副作用记录，是人们留在一款已经不喜欢的应用里的原因。没有人会把一整年的注射重新输入一遍，于是这些记录就成了枷锁。把它们迁移过来，才是唯一重要的部分。",
  "New in Dozify: snap a meal and the app drafts calories and protein per item for you to edit — <a href=\"/en/ai-calorie-tracker\">AI calorie tracking</a> (Premium) — and daily GLP-1 tablets have their own <a href=\"/en/glp1-pill-tracker\">pill tracker</a>.": "Dozify 新功能：拍下一餐，应用会为每样食物估算卡路里和蛋白质草稿，供你修改——<a href=\"/en/ai-calorie-tracker\">AI 卡路里记录</a>（Premium）；每日服用的 GLP-1 片剂也有了专属的<a href=\"/en/glp1-pill-tracker\">口服药记录</a>。",
  "Nothing is written until you say so": "在你确认之前，什么都不会写入",
  "Open your exported file and compare the header row. Dozify matches a column by any of these names, and it does not mind capitalisation or a unit written in brackets. Anything it cannot place is listed on the preview screen by name, so you can see what was left out rather than wondering.": "打开你导出的文件，对照表头行。Dozify 会按以下任一名称匹配列，不区分大小写，也不在意括号里写的单位。任何无法对应的列都会在预览界面上按名称列出，让你清楚看到哪些被略过，而不必猜测。",
