  "Terms": "条款",
  "The preview shows how many weights, injections and side effects were found, the dates they span, how many are already here, and how many rows could not be read and why. Dozify writes an automatic backup to your device first, and the import itself is one transaction: if anything fails it is rolled back completely, because half an imported history is worse than none.": "预览会显示找到了多少条体重、注射和副作用记录、它们覆盖的日期范围、其中多少条已经存在，以及有多少行无法读取和原因。Dozify 会先在你的设备上自动备份，导入本身是一次完整的事务：任何一步失败都会全部回滚，因为只导入一半的历史比完全没有更糟。",
  "The problem": "问题所在",
