  "Why the history is the hard part": "为什么历史记录是最难的部分",
  "Your health records stay on your device and are never uploaded; the one exception is a meal photo you choose to analyse with AI calories, sent only after you agree and not stored by the app. There is no account and no cloud sync. Usage statistics never carry a medication name or a symptom, details in the <a href=\"/en/privacy\">privacy policy</a>.": "你的健康记录保存在你的设备上，永远不会上传；唯一的例外是你选择用 AI 卡路里分析的餐食照片，只会在你同意后发送，且应用不会保存。没有账户，也没有云同步。使用统计从不包含药物名称或症状，详见<a href=\"/en/privacy\">隐私政策</a>。",
